{
  "name": "URLs to Markdown files (QuanticData)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# URLs to Markdown files\nScrapes each URL with the QuanticData scrape endpoint and returns one Markdown file per page (with YAML front matter), ready to download or to pass to a storage node.\n\n## Setup\n1. Create an API key on the QuanticData dashboard (API keys page).\n2. In n8n: Credentials > New > **Header Auth**. Name: `QuanticData API`, header name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_KEY`.\n3. Open each orange HTTP Request node and pick that credential.\n4. Edit **URLs to convert** and run the workflow.\n\nBilled per successful page: https://quanticdata.io/pricing/",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -160,
        -360
      ],
      "id": "575367b5-05e8-4d48-aa2c-500282ddd53f"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "name": "Start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        100
      ],
      "id": "a2db894b-9dea-4f78-ab38-15ad391d5de7"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "031b0caa-c887-473c-a086-99b700c98a64",
              "name": "urls",
              "value": "={{ ['https://quotes.toscrape.com/', 'https://books.toscrape.com/catalogue/a-light-in-the-attic_1000/index.html'] }}",
              "type": "array"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "URLs to convert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        100
      ],
      "id": "435ee23d-202c-471d-acd3-a73a6654c0c3"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "urls",
        "options": {
          "destinationFieldName": "url"
        }
      },
      "name": "One item per URL",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        100
      ],
      "id": "74844dbc-ea06-44a8-a06c-7e1ea0882eea"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.quanticdata.io/v1/scraper/extract",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"url\": \"{{ $json.url }}\",\n  \"format\": \"markdown\",\n  \"contentMode\": \"smart\",\n  \"frontmatter\": true\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 180000,
          "batching": {
            "batch": {
              "batchSize": 1,
              "batchInterval": 1000
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "name": "Scrape to Markdown",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        100
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "id": "578d2f6c-2193-45f8-a77e-e9bceed9b4f5"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// One output item per scraped page: a file name and the Markdown text\nreturn $input.all().map((item) => {\n  const page = item.json.payload;\n  const u = new URL(page.finalUrl || page.url);\n  const slug = (u.hostname + u.pathname).replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9]+/g, '-').replace(/^-|-$/g, '').toLowerCase();\n  return {\n    json: {\n      url: page.url,\n      title: page.title,\n      status: page.status,\n      fileName: (slug || 'page') + '.md',\n      markdown: page.content,\n    },\n  };\n});"
      },
      "name": "Name the file",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        880,
        100
      ],
      "id": "ab9845a9-d68c-44ed-a45c-caf2337b57b8"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "toText",
        "sourceProperty": "markdown",
        "options": {
          "fileName": "={{ $json.fileName }}"
        }
      },
      "name": "Markdown file",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1100,
        100
      ],
      "id": "33ccf77b-1cd4-413e-aaa8-f7f3d961ea10"
    }
  ],
